    <briefdescription>
<para>Inclusive version range constraint for plugin capability negotiation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Both bounds are optional: an empty string means &quot;no constraint&quot; on that bound. Example: {min_version=&quot;1.0.0&quot;, max_version=&quot;2.0.0&quot;} matches any version from 1.0.0 to 2.0.0 inclusive. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
